<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RTRS-Cricket-Australia v Border scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Australia v Border scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day of the three-day match between Border and Australia at Buffalo Park on Saturday:</p>
<p>Border first innings 117 (J.Gillespe 7-34)</p>
<p>Australia first innings (overnight 206-5)</p>
<p> M.Elliott c and b Emslie			    41</p>
<p> M.Hayden c Strydom b Ntini			   5</p>
<p> J.Langer lbw b Botha				  14</p>
<p> M.Bevan b Botha					  7</p>
<p> M.Waugh c Strydom b Emslie			  62</p>
<p> G.Blewett c Boucher b Strydom		    112</p>
